/etc/dovecot/conf.d/auth-lua.conf.ext<pre><code># Any of the above env vars needs to be explicitly imported here,
# in order to be available to the adapter script:
import_environment {
  USERLI_API_ACCESS_TOKEN=
  USERLI_HOST=
}

passdb lua {
  driver = lua
  lua_file = /usr/local/bin/userli-dovecot-adapter.lua
}

userdb lua {
  driver = lua
  lua_file = /usr/local/bin/userli-dovecot-adapter.lua
}
</code></pre> <p>Include it in your Dovecot configuration with <code>!include conf.d/auth-lua.conf.ext</code> and disable other <code>passdb</code>/<code>userdb</code> sections.</p>
